d line heights for various elements to improve visual hierarchy and comprehension. Considering responsive layout adjustments for different screen sizes, specifically ensuring a balanced three-area workspace on laptops, two-column or stacked grid on tablets, and prioritizing the teaching area on mobile devices.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/index.html\"","EndLine":"45","StartLine":"30","toolAction":"\"Viewing top secondary buttons in index.html\"","toolSummary":"\"Inspect button definitions in index.html\""}}]}
